        Quest("CH2-180",2,180,"Weapon of the Great Hunter",category="Orc City - Tag-Nor",giver = "Tag-Nor",location="Orc City - Tag-Nor",prerequisites="Complete Earn Tag-Nor's Respect and learn enough Orcish to speak with him.",summary="Gather rare materials and craft the legendary orc crossbow Drag Nimrod for Tag-Nor.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Ask Tag-Nor about missile weapons after earning his respect; he describes a legendary orc crossbow.","Gather 30 pieces of magic ore, five black ore, a tropical beech log in Jharkendar's forgotten canyon, puma sinews and the Great Hunter talisman.","Obtain a black cave troll horn, found on an appropriate troll in the Valley of Shadows, Plateau of the Ancients or Masyaf lair.","Show the materials to Tag-Nor; he sends you to Harad, then Thorben, for the crossbow stock design.","Pay Thorben to learn the stock construction and return to Tag-Nor for the crossbow recipe.","Learn to smelt magic ore from Viper or Hildur, prepare a suitable magic ore ingot and treat the puma sinews with mole-rat fat at an alchemy table.","Craft the stock at a woodworking bench and use the smelter at Netbek's forest camp to assemble Drag Nimrod.","Show the completed crossbow to Tag-Nor; keep it or hand it over for an additional reward."),reward="Reward varies by quest/build; exact values should be taken from the current in-game dialogue or source page.",warnings="This long chain needs several high-level regions and crafting skills; it may not be finishable during Chapter 2. Ingot quality affects the crossbow's final stats. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/oruzhie-velikogo-oxotnika.67198/",searchTags=listOf("weapon of the great hunter","orc city - tag-nor","local quest giver in orc city - tag-nor")),
